                    Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d209-f2" n="2" xml:id="d209-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to West’s discussion of the U.S.-Saudi military supply program in
                    telegram 1674 from Jidda, March 12. (National Archives, RG 59, Central Foreign
                    Policy File, D800130–0237)</p>
            </note>
