            </note>
            <note corresp="#d209-f4" n="4" xml:id="d209-f4-content">
                <p>
                    Duncan visited Saudi Arabia March 1–4.
                    He reported to the SCC on his trip on March 21.
                    See <ref target="#d210">Document 210</ref>.</p>
            </note>
